		{
			"id":"6440f2a794c163a3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"We were able to have VFX done for 2 shots, and both were rendered. We are in the process of rendering more shots, and I'm adding some credit screen renders.\nI also added sound effects and music to the video.\n\nIn this version contains all the newest playblasts and renders, some playblasts contains black frames, but this shouldn't be an issue once it is rendered\n\nleft to do:\n- render remaining scenes\n- match sound to the rendered scenes (if there is a mis match)\n- trailer",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":440,
			"y":-360,
			"width":500,
			"height":506
		},
		{"id":"62cc0080f4397182","type":"link","url":"https://youtu.be/z-A8B67g1dg","x":-240,"y":-360,"width":640,"height":360},
